WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:18.880
Por favor...

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.120
Hello! Um...

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.640
This is Veronica Aspen.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.520
I would like to register

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.960
for tomorrow's auction at your place.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.800
I'm sorry.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.000
Registration for the auction

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.480
is already closed.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:32.680
How?

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.280
So quickly?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.120
Tomorrow

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.920
we'll be showcasing exclusive lots.

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.800
The word spreads instantly,

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:42.920
that's why.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.160
But we do have another

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.920
interesting one in a week.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.960
Listen.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.000
Maybe you don't understand that

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.200
it's a matter of life and death for me.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.200
I'd love to help,

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.480
but the room will be full.

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:56.440
Please.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.760
Unless someone cancels.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.400
I’ve noted your number.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.000
Ma’am, are you there?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:08.960
Hello?

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.920
No! No, grandpa!

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:25.960
No, please!
